Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\blur3}（约克郡 红衣主教沃尔西的教堂别院）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为你了解历史 其实你了解的只是历史的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you know a story, but you only know how it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要了解历史的真谛 你必须回到历史的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get to the heart of the story, you have to go back to the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty, the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位大臣 各位议员 我们手头有很多工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords and councillors, there is a great deal of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:03:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过去那些掌权的人对我背信弃义\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the past, those who held the reins of government deceived me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不经我手 不经我允许 就擅自行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many things were done without my knowledge or my approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过这些小动作以后统统都要废除\N{\fnArial\fs30}But such proceedings will stop in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下您被委任为枢密院院长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace will be appointed president of the council.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与萨福克公爵共任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jointly with the Duke of Suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}短期内我们还要再开一次会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall convene again very shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}商讨与我们息息相关的大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}To discuss those matters which remain close to our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A word.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然沃尔西不与我们共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although it pleases me much…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我非常高兴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that Wolsey is no longer here among us, yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是即便他不在场 他也没有引起你的不安吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in his absence, does he not cause you disquiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么会？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只是被削权 并不是叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was attaindered, but not for treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是说他还能苟活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means he still lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且只要他还能苟延残喘 对王国 对你我都是一个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so long as he lives, he remains a danger both to the realm and to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被流放到约克郡了 彻底失宠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is far away in York. In disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.60,0:04:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得您太危言耸听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you exaggerate the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我觉得您并未明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think that you don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很清楚 国王非常善变\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king, as you know, could easily change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他真改了主意 沃尔西又重返宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he did, if Wolsey ever returned to this court…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.60,0:04:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你跟我都要担心他的复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we would both have cause enough to fear his vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真受不了 必须得修修房顶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is intolerable. We must have the roof mended.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用什么修？谁来修？\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what and by whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们既没钱也没有该死的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no money and no bloody servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王真打算让你如此潦倒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely, the king never meant you to live so wretchedly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟你还是约克郡的大教主呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, you are still archbishop of York.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能也不是国王的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, perhaps it's not the king's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不由得想起那古老的预言…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had cause to remember the old prophecy:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「当母牛骑上公牛 」神父们就要小心脑袋了「\N{\fnArial\fs30}"When the cow rideth the bull, then, priest, beware thy skull."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说安-博林是母牛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean that cow Anne Boleyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正因如此我才给她写这封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I'm writing her this letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她可是让我们穷困潦倒的罪魁祸首？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if she's the cause of all our misery?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 既然她是罪魁祸首 她也会是灵丹妙药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes, since she's the cause, she can also be the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我能说服她 我不是她的敌人 而是她的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have to persuade her that I am not her enemy, but her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我手上还有那封她写给我的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have the letter in which she promises to reward me…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信里跟我保证只要她一旦登位 就会为我的辛劳和努力而报答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for all my pains and efforts at such time as she becomes crowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恍惚记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to remember at the time…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时你认为她的保证荒唐可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you thought her promises rather amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:06:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 也许确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes, perhaps I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从那以后 我宁愿自己没有幽默感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since then I have rather lost my sense of humour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯大人 我注意到在您的办公处所 没有任何的配饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas, I notice you allow yourself none of the trappings of your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生 我还没有虚荣到 四处彰显权势的地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so vain as to display its power, Master Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我跟你说 我却有意好好利用权势\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I tell you this, I fully intend to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 请问… - 您要讲自己的权利用于哪些方面吗？这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May I ask to what effect? - Here, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这儿有一份最近呈上剑桥的 告诫报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is a report of a sermon recently given in Cambridge…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是一位名叫休-拉蒂莫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by a certain Hugh Latimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大学资深教员写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A senior member of the university. And I quote:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉蒂莫先生说「所有的基督教徒」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mr. Latimer said that holy scripture should be read in the English tongue…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「都应用英伦语言诵读圣经」 「不论是神父还是俗人 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of all Christian people whether priest or layman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他强烈抨击了为神像镀金的做法 认为那是「疯狂的膜拜」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He raged against the gilding of images…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「和迷信的魂祭 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the running of pilgrimages, and superstitious devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说「世间众人皆为神父」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that all men were priests…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「所谓的神父与教皇 吾等即可弃之 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and that we had no need for priests or popes on Earth."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世道变了 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Times have changed, Master Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我完全可以预见 对新奇和错误的教派 如此明目张胆的改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I plainly see the risk and danger involved in such an open-door policy…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有多么大的风险和危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}…towards these newfangled, erroneous sects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您控诉所有的改革者为异教徒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You condemn all Reformers as heretics?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西对他们太过纵容了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolsey was far too soft on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不准备这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend not to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您会烧死他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you burn them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「教皇以及神职人员所拥有的… 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This belief that pope and clergy possess separate power…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「自主权和威信 恰恰与圣经相违背」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and authority is contrary to scripture.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「国王才是上帝在世间的代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king is the representative of God on Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的法就是上帝的法令「\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and his law is God's law.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:07:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「统治者只对上帝一人聆讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ruler is accountable to God alone…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝授意所有子民都应顺从统治者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the obedience of his subjects is an obedience required by God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「至于由教堂和教皇 来统领欧洲各国君王\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the Church and the pope to rule the princes of Europe…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「则不仅是奇耻大辱 更是冒上天之大不韪\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is not only a shame above all shames but an inversion of the divine order.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.70,0:08:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「每个王国都以上帝之名 有一位国王亦即有一部王法 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}One king and one law in God's name in every realm."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这本书是为我所写 也为所有国王所写\N{\fnArial\fs30}This book is a book for me, and for all kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一些与此书类似的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are other books like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}详述教士们在陛下的领土之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Books which detail the abuses of power, privileges…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滥用职权 贪婪餐腥的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the greed of the clergy in Your Majesty's realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是那些沃尔西 不想给您看到的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Books which Wolsey deliberately kept hidden from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真该看看这些书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to read them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今我君权神授 亲自执政\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I've taken power unto myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必要时我就得夜以继日 处理国事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I shall work day and night if necessary to resolve things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然也包括废除我的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including my annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向你发誓 一切将会改观\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to you now everything will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 查普大使 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ambassador Chapuys. - Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说您是一位 能力超群 智慧过人的外交官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you are a very able and intelligent diplomat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信您和我一样 也留意到最近的宗教之争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like me, I'm sure you're aware of all the new religious controversies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然了 我听说新的异教四处涌现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know of some new heresies that have sprang up here and there, certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要教皇和他的红衣主教们 能放弃他们的虚架子和繁文缛节\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only the pope and his cardinals could set aside their vain pomp…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按照福音书和先父的意旨做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…start living according to the precepts of the gospels the and early fathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我留意到陛下您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am well aware Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正与教皇圣人进行辩论\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is in the midst of an argument with His Holiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.70,0:09:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是在说我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下 路德抨击教士们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, when Luther attacked the vice…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶行与腐败 您该清楚 他是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and corruption of the clergy, he was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只停留到这个地步 未能毁掉圣餐这一类东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had he stopped, and not gone on to destroy the sacraments…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会很高兴提笔为他声援\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and so on, I would have raised my pen in his defence…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是对他口诛笔伐\N{\fnArial\fs30}…rather than attacking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教会需要改革是显而易见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The need for reformation in the Church is manifest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一国之王有责任促进改革 就如我在我的领土之内所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor has a duty to promote it. As do I in my own domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真高兴我们俩有机会交流意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad we've had this opportunity to exchange opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我很奇怪你怎么会有这么多时间 - 做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm surprised you have so much time. - To do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 无事可做 - 你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To do nothing. - What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不应该在管理国事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you supposed to be running the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都丢给诺福克了 他经验老到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave that to Norfolk. He's had more practise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.40,0:10:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再说 和各国大使会面真是无聊透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, meetings with ambassadors, infinitely tedious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都是谎话精 伪君子和老不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all liars, hypocrites, and middle-aged men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你更情愿他们是女人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you prefer them to be women?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果所有的大使都是漂亮女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, if all ambassadors were beautiful women…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会夜以继日地为国操劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'd be serving my country day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们来了 - 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here we are. - Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来介绍我的护卫 这是凯瑟琳-布鲁克小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me present my ward, Miss Catherine Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是安东尼-耐福特爵士 - 凯瑟琳小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir Anthony Knivert. - Miss Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.50,0:11:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 先生 - 安东尼是最优秀的骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir. - Anthony's one of our finest horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.00,0:11:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了我跌下来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for when I fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你散步愉快吗？- 是的 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You enjoying your walk? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好 我就不耽搁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Then I shan't delay you any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你前行的兴致了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your back into it, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 一个小尤物 不是吗？- 确是尤物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pretty little thing, isn't she? - Indeed, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要娶她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您曾被流放过对吧 费什先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been in exile, Mr. Fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把我滞留在荷兰是沃尔西主教的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Cardinal Wolsey's pleasure to keep me in Holland…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他害怕我会说出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for fear I might speak the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你为什么要试图归来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did you try to return?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得 随着红衣主教的倒台和遣走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought, sir, that with the cardinal fallen and sent away…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个国家的境况会变好\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that circumstances in this country might be changed for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}氛围会更加宽容\N{\fnArial\fs30}More tolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这个国家你有朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have friends in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 当然了 我可是英国人 - 在宫廷呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course, sir, as an Englishman. - At court?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在宫廷有无朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have friends at court?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不否认这是你的作品吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you deny you are the author of this work…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「乞丐的祈愿」\N{\fnArial\fs30}…A Supplication for the Beggars?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么内容？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.80,0:12:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请求陛下更正对教派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, an appeal to His Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.10,0:12:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怕而又诽谤性的迫害\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to redress many of the terrible and scandalous abuses of the Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你似乎建议的是 教会的真正目的是夺取贵族权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem to suggest that the real aim of the Church…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夺取国王的尊贵与公信\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is to seize all power, lordship, obedience and dignity from the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.00,0:12:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上你更过分 你声称教会是叛党之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, you go further. You claim that the Church itself…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}违抗国王之威名\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is a source of rebellion and disobedience against the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是吗 费什先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you, Mr. Fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有这儿 费什先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here, Mr. Fish, if I may.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「对人民的苛捐杂税\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that the exactions taken from the people…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是献给了仁慈而又现世的君王\N{\fnArial\fs30}…are not given to a kind, temporal prince…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「而是冷酷而又残暴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but to "a cruel, devilish bloodsucker…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渴饮着殉教者和圣徒们血的嗜血者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…drunken in the blood of the martyrs and saints of Christ."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真为你感到羞耻 费什先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame on you, Mr. Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}替那些被你称为冷酷残暴的嗜血者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For who are these cruel, devilish bloodsuckers…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但也同时是神圣教会的基督神父们 而感到羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the anointed priests of our holy Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们为我们指引通往天堂的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who show us the way to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.90,0:13:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你不再坚信这一点了 对吗 费什先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, you don't believe in that either, do you, Mr. Fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.80,0:13:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是一个虔诚的基督徒 永恒之乐的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Christian man, the child of everlasting joy…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经历过上帝所赐予的苦难磨练\N{\fnArial\fs30}…through the merits of the bitter passion of Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是虔诚圣悦的回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the joyful answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是异端之辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is also heresy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是怎么回事？她又出什么花招？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What has she done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她穿着紫色\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is wearing purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}紫色是王权的颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}And purple is the colour of royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时我真希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I sometimes wish…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的西班牙人都葬身海底\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that all Spaniards were at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}博林女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Boleyn…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您不该用这种话污蔑王后的尊贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you should not abuse the queen's honour with such language.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我根本不在乎凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I care nothing for Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我宁愿她吊死 也不愿尊称她为主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather see her hanged than acknowledge her as my mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可以了吗？- 是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that it? - Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事情 克伦威尔先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Mr. Cromwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我说话之前 我要请求陛下的宽容与原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must beg Your Majesty's indulgence, and forgiveness, before I…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近我有事去了一趟沃尔瑟姆修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had cause, recently, on a visit to Waltham Abbey…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与一位学识渊博的朋友倾谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to speak to a learned friend there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们聊到… 陛下的离婚大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We spoke about Your Majesty's great matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们总结道陛下的顾问不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came to the conclusion Your Majesty's advisers…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能不会以常见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…might not, perhaps, be approaching the matter…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解决方式达成此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the most convenient way to solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你的意思是法庭裁决不可行？ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean through the courts? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 如陛下所知 国王凌驾于法律之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Your Majesty well knows, kings are set above the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们只听上帝的旨意 上帝让国王们成为神子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are answerable to God alone, who anointed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以这似乎告诉我们 此事绝非关系到法律事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it seems to us that the matter is not, and never has been, a legal one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只关神权\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a theological one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那样的话 谁来裁决此事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in that case, who should pass verdict upon it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would suggest…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下在欧洲各大学院\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that Your Majesty canvass the opinion of theologians…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仔细研究神学家的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at colleges around Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的檄文会很快出炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their sentence would be pronounced…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}略施小技就可执行\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and could be implemented with little industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只凭这简单的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by that simple measure…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信陛下困扰许久的良知 会随之平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I trust that Your Majesty's troubled conscience might be pacified.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.60,0:16:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能就你的观点写一篇文章吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you write a paper showing your argument?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 如果陛下信任我这么做的话 - 不 我命令你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lf Your Majesty trusts me to do so. - No, I command you to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还命令你以御史身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I command you, as a royal agent…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}探访欧洲各所大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}…visit the universities in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.00,0:16:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要尽快得到神学者们的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the opinion of their theological faculties as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有时间让您放弃异教 菲什先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still time to recant of your heresy, Mr. Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你承认你的观点都是受人误导 是罪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you acknowledge that your opinions were misguided, evil…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是违背上帝法则的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…contrary to the law of God…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样你就可以减少痛苦 否则你就会痛不欲生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then you will be spared the great pains you must otherwise endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我请求你意识到自己的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg of you, acknowledge your sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝会重新张开怀抱欢迎你回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}God will welcome you back into his fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放弃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:18:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recant, you still have a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的主是我的守护者 我别无所求\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord is my shepherd, I can want nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他指引我至青草地上 他指引我至清泉水边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He feedeth me in green pastures, he leadeth me to fresh waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我虽行入死亡的阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I should walk now in the valley of the shadow of death…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.40,0:18:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不畏惧邪恶 因为你与我同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}…yet I will fear no evil, for thou art with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的权杖 你的盾牌 都赐我慰藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thy staff and thy sheep, they comfort me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我敌人面前 你为我摆设筵席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thou preparest a table for me, against mine enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你用油膏神化我的头 使我福杯满溢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My head Thou anoints with oil, and filleth my cup full.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我一生一世 必有恩惠慈爱伴随于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, let thy loving-kindness and mercy follow me all the days of my life…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我且要住在主的殿中 直到永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I mayest dwell in the Lord's house for ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.30,0:20:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有些事情要对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something I want to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决定册封你和你的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided to ennoble you and your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你被册封为威尔彻和奥蒙德伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to be created Earl of Wiltshire and Ormonde…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时我委任你为掌玺大臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I am also appointing you Lord Privy Seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.50,0:20:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔治被封位罗彻福爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}George will become Lord Rochford…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时成为枢密院一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and be made a member of council.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.30,0:20:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我受宠若惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I'm lost for words.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这真是皇恩浩荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bounty is unceasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同时对克伦威尔先生寄予厚望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also have high hopes for Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴 他是我们家族的一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad. He is a friend of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道他的论文\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know his thesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你出访博洛尼亚 拜见教皇和罗马皇帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to visit the pope and the emperor at Bologna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.80,0:20:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去呈上我们新的申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to put to them our new case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请告诉我 您没有放弃希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me you are not losing hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我常常幻想国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had always fancied that the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在追逐风流一段时间之后 仍然能回心转意\N{\fnArial\fs30}…after pursuing his course for some time, would turn away…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想臣服他的良知 改变他的心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would yield to his conscience, and change his purpose…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像以前他常做的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as he has done so often before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾坚信用我全部的身心 让他回归理性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believed with all my heart that he would return to reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如今 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我为您祈祷 不要放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, I pray you. Don't give way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 阁下 我从未放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Excellence. I shall never give way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你赐予我父亲的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for what you have done for my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及我家族的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:21:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以后还会有的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.80,0:22:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把沃尔西在约克郡的老宅 做了些改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made alterations to Wolsey's old palace at York Place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说过你喜欢那里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.60,0:22:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要把那个地方送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am giving it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我惹你不高兴了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I made you unhappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.20,0:22:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.20,0:22:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不再钟情于我 我才会伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would only be unhappy if you ever stopped loving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那要伦敦首先容融化流入泰晤士河\N{\fnArial\fs30}London would have to melt into the Thames first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是为安妮准备的一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is everything now for the lady Anne?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯先生 这有没有让你觉得像一场喜筵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas, does this not remind you of a wedding feast?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像就差一个牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me that nothing is wanted but a priest…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.30,0:22:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给他们佩戴戒指 宣布誓言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to give away the nuptial rings and pronounce the blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.80,0:22:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}God forbid that should happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.70,0:23:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实这不关我事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我作为大臣的新工作就是竭力\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new job as chancellor…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.10,0:23:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吸引基督教徒的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will be to do my utmost to contend for the interests of Christendom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.60,0:23:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the king's Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下更倾向于改革者\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is more inclined towards the Reformers than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不这么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然我比你更了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know him better than you do, Excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.40,0:23:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他最深的本能传统而坚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}His deepest instincts are traditional and faithful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.40,0:23:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也许会放言与罗马断交\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may threaten to break with Rome…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不认为他会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I don't think he will ever do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.00,0:23:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.30,0:23:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则后果将无法想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The consequences would be unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.10,0:23:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事态正如您期望的发展 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything seems to move in your favour, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.40,0:23:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.10,0:23:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说国王送给\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to know that the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.30,0:23:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西一尊他的玉石雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has sent Wolsey an intaglio portrait of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那又怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:24:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这通常是示好的表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it is traditionally a sign of goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这预示着他们将重修旧好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may presage a reconciliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.40,0:24:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王的小礼物只是为了 让自己良心得到安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small gift to ease the king's conscience is hardly a sign…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不代表失宠的主教还能恢复名望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that the bishop of York will be restored to his former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}换个角度想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.70,0:24:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从天堂坠落的圣人 有人邀请他回去么\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Satan fell from heaven, was he ever invited back?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.10,0:24:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怀亚特先生 听说您接受了克伦威尔先生的庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that you have accepted patronage from Mr. Cromwell, Mr. Wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.40,0:24:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界真透明啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very transparent the world is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.50,0:24:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塔利斯 我这么做有错么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But was I wrong to do so, Tallis?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.40,0:24:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我觉得有 你应该靠你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so. Yeah. You should be your own man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.70,0:24:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别傻了 塔利斯 在这个坠落的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a fool, Tallis. You won't survive long in this slippery world…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.30,0:24:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有靠山的人是站不住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without the support of a great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.80,0:24:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得克伦威尔能作靠山？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Mr. Cromwell is a great man?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.40,0:24:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我感觉他未来大有前途 记住我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think he's a coming man. Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.30,0:25:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直跟你说了吧 我的确上了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what it's worth, I did fuck her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.30,0:25:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.10,0:25:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到了回信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had a reply to my letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.90,0:25:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}博林夫人寄来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Mistress Boleyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.50,0:25:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.90,0:25:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不想在国王那替我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That she will not speak to the king on my behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的希望破灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then our hopes are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.20,0:25:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想给一个更有权利的女士写封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have resolved to write to another lady…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.40,0:26:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个比那个可恶的娼妓更为尊贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who is far greater, far greater than that mischievous whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.30,0:26:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更有可能发发慈悲的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And far more likely to be kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.30,0:26:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 国王来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, the king is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.70,0:26:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Be seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.50,0:26:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.20,0:26:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说您身体欠佳 于是过来探望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came because I heard you were unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.70,0:26:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生给你放点血也是必要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that it was necessary for the physician to have bled you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.04,0:26:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你现在感觉怎么样？ - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you feeling now? - I am very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.50,0:26:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很好 感谢陛下的关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty is kind to show concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.53,0:27:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的女儿怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is our daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她用漂亮的拉丁文给我写信说 她每天都在练习三拍舞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She writes to me in perfect Latin and tells me she dances the galliards…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.20,0:27:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弹得一手好琵琶 让人们都欢愉满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and can play the lute much to everyone's satisfaction and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.30,0:27:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你应当引以为傲 - 我的确为她骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should be proud of her. - I am proud of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.10,0:27:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该请她入宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to invite her to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.90,0:27:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以看她唱歌娱乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could watch her dancing and playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.10,0:27:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 会让你很高兴的 - 凯瑟琳…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It might please you. - Catherine, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.30,0:27:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说你派了几个代表出国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear that several of your agents…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.90,0:27:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去研究离婚的神学主张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have been sent abroad to canvass theological opinion about the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.40,0:27:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能找出一个支持你的学者\N{\fnArial\fs30}For every scholar that votes for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.20,0:27:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就能找出1000个支持我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I could find a thousand who would vote for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.00,0:28:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.10,0:28:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每天我都被强迫看这些表示不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}…every day I'm forced to read new reports of dissatisfaction…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.90,0:28:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说我的国家混乱低效的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}…confusion and delays throughout my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.30,0:28:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们国库空虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}My exchequer is empty…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.10,0:28:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正在以高价利息从外借款\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we are borrowing money at a biting rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.80,0:28:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是议会的大臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Graces are presidents of this council…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.10,0:28:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个问题我从没听过你们的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and yet I hear nothing from you on these matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.95,0:28:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他问题也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor any other matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.88,0:28:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 您必须宽恕我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty must forgive me…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.70,0:28:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道我必须原谅你 我一直在宽恕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know. I must always forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我已经厌倦了宽恕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I grow tired of forgiving you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.10,0:28:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给了你一切 甚至自称王子的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have given you everything, including the right to call yourself prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.07,0:28:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得到什么回报了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do I get in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.40,0:28:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前我认为主教爱慕虚荣 自私贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to think the cardinal vain, self-serving and greedy…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像你们跟我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just as you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.70,0:29:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我体会到了他肩负的重担… 毫无怨言\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I understand the burden he carried, uncomplainingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.20,0:29:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下也不能忘了他监守自盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty should not forget that he also stole from you…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.60,0:29:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对法国的效忠甚至\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and he served the interests of the French…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.30,0:29:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多于英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}…even above those of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.80,0:29:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是这么想的么 托马斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think, Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.40,0:29:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确主教虚荣至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is certainly true that the cardinal was vainglorious beyond measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.50,0:29:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这极度的腐化了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did him tremendous harm…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.80,0:29:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}使他滥用上帝赐予他的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and made him abuse the considerable gifts God gave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.06,0:29:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是他在治理国家方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet he is a better man than any of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.10,0:29:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比你们都强\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for managing this kingdom's matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.50,0:29:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我会跟他谈谈 - 是 你必须要跟他谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will talk to him. - Yes, you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.52,0:29:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 查普大使参见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambassador Chapuys, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambassador.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.90,0:30:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我这有给您的一封信 - 罗马皇帝给我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have a letter for Your Majesty. - From the emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.57,0:30:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 沃尔西主教给您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. From Cardinal Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太… 太奇怪了 他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so strange. Do you know what it says?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.40,0:30:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教希望您和他 包括罗马和罗马皇帝之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cardinal is offering to create a rapprochement…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.34,0:30:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够重新和解\N{\fnArial\fs30}…between you and he, the emperor, and Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.70,0:30:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马教皇布告的到达 就是政变的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coup would be signalled by the arrival of a papal edict…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.63,0:30:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迫使亨利放弃安妮博林 回复他的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ordering Henry to leave Anne Boleyn and return to his marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.37,0:30:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝会给他经济和道义支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor will offer his financial and moral support…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.10,0:30:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并让沃尔西重新做回议政大臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and insist that Wolsey be reinstated as chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.88,0:30:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为这一方法有效吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think it could work?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.16,0:30:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红衣主教拥有最多的就是智慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cardinal is nothing if not ingenious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.60,0:30:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望您成立新的议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to set up a new parliament.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.30,0:30:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些大事需要解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Important things need to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.80,0:30:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如我的国库空虚一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My exchequer is empty, for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.10,0:31:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会谨遵您的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will do as Your Majesty commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.90,0:31:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我要指出 这个新国会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must warn you that you may not find this parliament…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.00,0:31:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许不会像以前的那个一样忠诚于您\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as compliant as those before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.40,0:31:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.80,0:31:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然我一直与那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, though I must confess to being amongst those…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.60,0:31:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求容忍和言论自由的人一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who called for greater tolerance and freedom of speech…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.60,0:31:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但恐怕如果陛下仁慈地给予了这些自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I fear that the freedom so given by Your Majesty's kindness…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.00,0:31:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那它们将被滥用\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is now openly abused.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.00,0:31:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国家内对于宗教问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many dissenting voices in the kingdom…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.20,0:31:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很多不同的议论\N{\fnArial\fs30}…chiefly on religious matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.60,0:31:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是在要求改革\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are calls for a reformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.70,0:31:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯 你烧死了多少人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many have you burned, Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.50,0:31:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}6个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.80,0:31:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是按法律规程 有必要的… 并且处理妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}All lawful, necessary and well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.70,0:31:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}处理妥当？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.20,0:31:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.60,0:32:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.30,0:32:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in so many words…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.20,0:32:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说他更倾向于宽恕沃尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he told me that he was inclined to pardon Wolsey…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.20,0:32:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重新宠信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and restore him to royal favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.40,0:32:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么回答的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.10,0:32:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意国王的观点 主教的确有很多才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agreed with His Majesty that the cardinal had many talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.90,0:32:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.80,0:32:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意国王的观点 主教的确有很多才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agreed with the king that His Eminence had many talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.50,0:32:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.50,0:32:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从未想过如果他重新掌权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you not spoken yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.30,0:32:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我们每个人将会做出\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of the terrible vengeance he would exact on us…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.00,0:32:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么可怕的报复吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if he ever again had the power?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.00,0:32:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许你不认为「复仇」 也是他的众多「才能」之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or perhaps you don't think vengeance to be one of his many talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.20,0:33:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当然明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.70,0:33:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我才故意顺应国王的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I cultivate the king's good graces.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.70,0:33:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您肯定乐意知道 万众向往的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty will be pleased to know that the University of Paris…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.10,0:33:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴黎大学已经声明要助您一臂之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the greatest prize of all, has declared in your favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.60,0:33:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}意大利呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Italy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.80,0:33:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须要说 那边的学院已经瓦解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I confess that the universities there are divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.40,0:33:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是帕多瓦 佛罗伦萨和威尼斯 的学院都支持陛下您\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Padua, Florence and Venice have all declared for Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.70,0:33:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西班牙呢？凯瑟琳的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spain? Catherine's country?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.80,0:33:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西班牙反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spain is against.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.10,0:33:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很惊讶么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.80,0:33:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.20,0:33:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你见到罗马皇帝和教皇了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get to see the emperor and His Holiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.70,0:33:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.90,0:34:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 罗马皇帝拒绝见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, the emperor refused to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.10,0:34:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And His Holiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.50,0:34:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇只是让我把这部布告带给陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pope simply gave me this edict, to bring to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.00,0:34:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布告怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.40,0:34:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布告上要求您\N{\fnArial\fs30}The edict instructs Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.20,0:34:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将安-博林女士逐出宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to order Lady Anne Boleyn to leave your court.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.30,0:34:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在教皇制元老院的裁定下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It refuses to allow Your Majesty permission to remarry…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.20,0:34:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们拒绝批准陛下您离婚一案\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while the papal curia is deciding Your Majesty's case.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.80,0:34:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怀亚特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.80,0:34:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我很忙 - 这个东西你该看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am busy. - There is someone you should see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.20,0:34:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 现在不行 怀亚特先生 - 这事关主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not now, Mr. Wyatt. - It concerns the cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.60,0:35:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 有什么能效劳的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Excellency. What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.70,0:35:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我有一事相求\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord, I would ask you a very great favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.10,0:35:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这么一个混乱的年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are troubled times.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.40,0:35:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}貌似在一些地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me that in certain quarters…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.60,0:35:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对神圣教堂的抱怨和敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there is now a blatant and open hostility to our holy Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.30,0:35:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 正如我们在德国所发现的情形 - 你希望我做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As we discovered in Germany… - And what do you expect me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.60,0:35:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望您能使用 您在宫廷和这里的强大影响力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you to use the great influence you have here at court…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.10,0:35:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把英国从灾难和毁灭的边缘拉回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to pull England back from the brink of catastrophe and ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.20,0:35:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在主和他的信徒们给我们的恩泽上\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love we all bear for Christ and his apostles.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.30,0:35:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么信徒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What apostles?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.30,0:35:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不相信主和信徒 即使是圣彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe Christ had apostles, not even Saint Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.60,0:35:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些都是以上帝之名假意遵从她的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men were all charlatans…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.50,0:35:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的骗子和伪君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who pretended to follow Christ and speak in his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.00,0:35:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们把教堂构建在谎言之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they built a Church upon their lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.40,0:35:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝之母啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.30,0:35:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人… 大人… 十分感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Honour, Your Honour, so grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.80,0:35:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 他是奥古斯蒂尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this is Augustus de Augustinis.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.80,0:35:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯-沃尔西的私人医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A private physician to Thomas Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.80,0:35:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西 你了解他么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolsey? What do you know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.90,0:36:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我知道沃尔西求助于罗马皇帝和…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I know that Wolsey sought the help of the emperor and the p…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.90,0:36:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 罗马教皇？- 是的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The pope? - Yes, your honour…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.50,0:36:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}教皇 反对… 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…His Holiness the pope. Against His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.90,0:36:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他们有联络？ - 是的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They communicated? - Yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.70,0:36:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.00,0:36:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西和凯瑟琳女王串通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolsey conspired with Queen Catherine…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.60,0:36:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说这是他唯一能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because he said it was the only way that he could be…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.90,0:36:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 重拾权力的方法 - 是啊… 是啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Restored to power. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.30,0:36:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王必须知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king must know of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.70,0:36:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道真相了 你一定要阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you know the truth, you must act against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.60,0:36:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和他的牧师教士认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and his fellow priests and prelates…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.80,0:36:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们能控制您的王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}…think they can control Your Majesty's realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.60,0:36:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认为他们比你更为位高权重\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they are higher than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.60,0:36:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵从教皇的旨意绝对不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by taking instruction from the pope…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.80,0:36:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西身为驻外使节的本分\N{\fnArial\fs30}…was not Wolsey acting as an agent of a foreign country?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.80,0:36:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自以为是的教皇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The presumption of the pope…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.70,0:37:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认为他能指挥你… 告诉你该干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…thinking he could tell you, you, what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.00,0:37:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人 不许动 这是国王的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolsey, sir. In the name of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.10,0:37:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 起来 - 从床上下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up. - Get out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.50,0:37:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 不 - 不管他的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no. - He's done nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.30,0:37:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯-沃尔西 国王下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thomas Wolsey, you are arrested by order of the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.20,0:37:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以高度叛国罪名逮捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and charged with high treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.40,0:37:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你将被转押到伦敦 在那里接受审讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be taken to London, where you will be tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.10,0:37:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 走开 琼 - 守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There, there, Joan. - Guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.10,0:37:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要哭 不要为我哭泣 我求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tears. No tears for me, I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.30,0:37:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.60,0:37:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没能给你留下些什么 值得你记住我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you have not much to remember me by.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.40,0:38:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我一生和每件事都是你给的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I have a life and everything in it to remember you by.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.10,0:38:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}守卫 铐住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards, shackle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.70,0:38:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布兰登啊 布兰登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, Brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.60,0:38:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我效忠上帝犹如 效忠国王一样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had served God as diligently as I served the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.30,0:38:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就不会在我两鬓斑白时抛弃我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he would not have given me up in my grey hairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.80,0:38:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.70,0:38:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.00,0:38:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.40,0:38:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 很遗憾通知您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I regret to have to inform Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.30,0:38:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能继续在这个宫里 为罗马皇帝效劳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I can no longer continue to serve the emperor at this court.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:39:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里对于一切神圣和真实的事情 充满了愤恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is so much hatred here for everything that is sacred and true…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.20,0:39:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些厚颜无耻大肆宣扬此言论的人 让我无法留在此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that those who speak brazenly of it have driven me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.40,0:39:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.20,0:39:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一直在用你的智慧和仁慈为我效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have always served me with wisdom and kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.90,0:39:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永生难忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.80,0:39:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我的外甥带好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send my love to my nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.50,0:39:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会告诉皇帝您的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will inform His Highness of your plight…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.50,0:39:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他国王陛下对您 怨恨和恶劣的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and of the malice and unkindness of His Majesty towards you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.50,0:39:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.70,0:39:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要告诉他 我对这个国家的爱 正如我对他本人的爱一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this also, for the love I bear this country as well as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.50,0:39:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不能对国王陛下和他的百姓动武\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must not think to use force against His Majesty or his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.50,0:39:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则 那将是违背良知 违背上帝的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be a sin against my conscience and against God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主啊 我们本该经常倾谈 可却未能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, we have not spoken as long or as often as we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.30,0:41:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我却总在忙其他的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have often been about other business.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.70,0:42:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我想要请求宽恕 我可以向您要求…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted forgiveness, I should ask for it…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.50,0:42:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but for all that I have done…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.10,0:42:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及所有我还未做到的事情 我是无法被您原谅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and for all that I am yet to do, there can be no forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.70,0:42:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我认为我并不是个邪恶的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, I think, I'm not an evil man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.60,0:42:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然邪恶之人大声祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though evil men pray louder…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.60,0:42:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寻求忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and seek penance…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.76,0:42:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认为他们比我距离天堂更近\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and think themselves closer to heaven than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.20,0:42:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看不见天堂的大门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall not see its gates, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.20,0:43:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也听不见您挽救我的箴言…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor hear your sweet words of salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.30,0:43:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到了永生 我发誓…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen eternity, I swear…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.50,0:43:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那只是一场梦 天亮后就烟消云散\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it was in a dream, and in the morning all was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.20,0:43:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我清楚了解我自己是怎样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know myself for what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.20,0:43:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将献上我卑微的灵魂 祈求您的宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I throw my poor soul upon your forgiveness…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.80,0:43:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我清楚的知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the full knowledge that I deserve none…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.80,0:43:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不配得到您的任何慈爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}…at your loving hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.80,0:44:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎… 到地狱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.55,0:44:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.50,0:45:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.90,0:45:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.60,0:45:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃尔西主教死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cardinal Wolsey is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.10,0:45:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万分遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.40,0:46:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish he'd have lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.10,0:46:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他怎么死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.10,0:46:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自我了断…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.00,0:46:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这件事不能张扬 明白么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one must ever know. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.90,0:46:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能让任何人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one. Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.80,0:46:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等我射完这轮 我们再好好谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll finish my game, and we'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.70,0:46:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.20,0:46:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.90,0:46:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.70,0:47:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}托马斯先生 我刚听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Thomas, I have just heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.70,0:47:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王下令 15位资深牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}By His Majesty's order, 15 senior clergymen…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.20,0:47:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于承认沃尔西的权威而被捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}…have been arrested for recognising Wolsey's authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.10,0:47:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}议会还有一项法令\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is also a statute before parliament…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.80,0:47:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}承认在当前各种适宜上以及精神上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which recognizes in matters temporal and spiritual…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.60,0:47:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王的命令凌驾于法律 并且只听从上帝的教诲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the king is above the law and shall give account to God alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.00,0:47:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.00,0:48:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想起来沃尔西曾经告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am reminded of something Wolsey once told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.40,0:48:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只可以告诉国王他该做什么 而不是他能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I should only tell the king what he ought to do not what he could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.80,0:48:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果狮子知道了自己的力量 就没人能控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For if the lion knows his own strength, no man could control him."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.60,0:48:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们站在深渊的边缘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're standing on the edge of the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.30,0:48:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝知道我们要遭遇什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows what shall become of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.60,0:49:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.80,0:50:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我忍不住了 - 不 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna come. - No, you mustn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.40,0:51:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许你能想出一种方法 让他对你的兴趣… 更加持久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you could imagine a way to keep his interest more prolonged?
